From 30316a8cbba351fa9be5f4d46d5ab94c05f937d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:07:20 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/31] kcm_keyboard: layouts first, typing options below,
 keyboard model on its own sub-page
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: List (layouts) with the footer form. The three tabs of unlike things were already sub-pages; the main page
now answers the most common task first (docs/page-design.md sections 1, 2). Config keys, kcfg, XKB, KGlobalAccel and
tastenbrett calls are unchanged.

Moved / renamed (inventory/relabel/kcm_keyboard.tsv):
- Layouts list first (was below Model / NumLock / Key repeat / Test area); "Add…" is the page action.
- Footer form now has sections: Switching (Change layout shortcut, Configure Switching…, Spare layouts), Typing
  (NumLock on startup, Key repeat with Delay and Rate, Test area), Keyboard (buttons).
- "Model:" moved to the sub-page "Keyboard Model…" and is now "Keyboard model:" (kcm_keyboard/keyboardModel);
  "Key Bindings" is a "Key Bindings…" button in the Keyboard section (was a toolbar action) (kcm_keyboard/KeyBindings).
- "ksr:" markers added on every control whose label or place changed or is text-only.

Speed (cause from code, not measured):
- KeyboardModel (all keyboard models from the XKB rules, sorted through a KSortFilterProxyModel) was built in the
  first frame for the Model combo; it is now created only when "Keyboard Model…" is opened.
- The empty-state text bound kcm.defaultLayout even while the list had layouts; defaultLayout can do a blocking
  system-bus call to org.freedesktop.locale1 (kcm_keyboard.cpp:199, FollowLocale1) plus Rules lookups. It is now only
  evaluated when the list is empty.
- Not changed (needs a build to do safely): Rules::self() still parses the whole XKB ruleset on first use, which the
  layout list and the XKB options model also need (xkb_rules.cpp:120-134). Next idea: parse lazily/threaded.
- Numbers: before ~1.85 s under load (ranking only). After: pending, manager will measure.

HIG: HIG-001, HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-019, HIG-047, HIG-057.

Not built yet (freeze). Unconfirmed: ScrollViewKCM without a header and a FormLayout footer with section Separators.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
